#: ../../user/configuration.md:40
msgid ""
"ReScript 11 is **not supported**. The decision and rationale are recorded"
" in [PRD §10 row 7](https://github.com/Nagatatz/rescript-"
"tauri/blob/main/docs/product-requirements.md) and the corresponding "
"[steering document](https://github.com/Nagatatz/rescript-"
"tauri/tree/main/.steering/20260508-002-rescript-v12-only)."
msgstr ""
"ReScript 11 は **サポート対象外** です。決定経緯と根拠は [PRD §10 行 "
"7](https://github.com/Nagatatz/rescript-tauri/blob/main/docs/product-"
"requirements.md) と対応する [ステアリングドキュメント](https://github.com/Nagatatz"
"/rescript-tauri/tree/main/.steering/20260508-002-rescript-v12-only) "
"に記録されています。"

#: ../../user/configuration.md:42
